{"v":1,"book":"Jer","ch":47,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The word of Jehovah that came to Jeremiah the prophet concerning the Philistines before Pharaoh struck Gaza.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" that came to "},{"t":"Jeremiah","s":["H3414"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"prophet","s":["H5030"],"a":[6]},{"t":" concerning the "},{"t":"Philistines","s":["H6430"],"a":[8]},{"t":" before "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"struck","s":["H5221"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Gaza","s":["H5804"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Thus says Jehovah, See, waters are rising up from the north And will become an overflowing stream; And they will overflow the land and all that fills it, The city and those who dwell in it; And men will cry out, And every inhabitant of the land will howl.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", See, "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[4]},{"t":" are rising "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[5]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"north","s":["H6828"],"a":[6]},{"t":" And will become an "},{"t":"overflowing","s":["H7857"],"a":[9]},{"t":" stream; And they will "},{"t":"overflow","s":["H7857"],"a":[10]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and all that fills it, The "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and those who "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[14]},{"t":" in it; And "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[17]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"cry","s":["H2199"],"a":[16]},{"t":" out, And every "},{"t":"inhabitant","s":["H3427"],"a":[20]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[21]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"howl","s":["H3213"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"At the sound of the stamping of the hooves of his stallions, At the rushing of his chariots, at the rumbling of his wheels, The fathers will not turn back for their children, Because of the feebleness of their hands,","